---
const appUrl = import.meta.env.PUBLIC_APP_URL ?? 'https://app.micomodoro.com';
const ctaUrl = `${appUrl}/auth?plan=free&ref=landing`;
---

<section class="pt-32 pb-20 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 bg-gradient-to-b from-slate-50 to-white">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center">
    <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-primary-50 text-primary-700 text-xs font-semibold px-3 py-1 rounded-full mb-6">
      <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-primary-500 rounded-full"></span>
      Sin tarjeta requerida · Prueba gratuita
    </span>
    <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 leading-tight mb-6">
      Toma el control de tu dinero,<br class="hidden sm:block"/>
      <span class="text-primary-600">un centavo a la vez</span>
    </h1>
    <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-10">
      Mi Comodoro te ayuda a organizar tu presupuesto, registrar tus gastos
      y construir hábitos financieros sólidos.
      Sin bancos, sin permisos, solo tú y tu dinero.
    </p>
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center">
      <a
        href={ctaUrl}
        class="bg-primary-600 hover:bg-primary-700 text-white font-semibold px-8 py-3 rounded-xl transition-colors text-base"
      >
        Empezar gratis
      </a>
      <a
        href="#planes"
        class="border border-slate-300 hover:border-primary-400 text-slate-700 font-semibold px-8 py-3 rounded-xl transition-colors text-base"
      >
        Ver planes
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
